[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0010","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0020","text":"这次的委托\n有点难呢～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0030","text":"是啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0040","text":"诶嘿嘿，欢迎回来！\n主人大人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0042","text":"客户"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0050","text":"嗯……倒是不错……\n但这样…………还想要再多一点巧思……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0060","text":"……多一点巧思……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0080","text":"甘奈，要不要点个甜点？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0090","text":"都说脑子累了的时候吃点甜的好\n说不定吃了就能想到什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31400200_01_0100","text":"这个主意好！\n我一直很在意这里的奶油蛋糕呢☆"}]
